WEBVTT

00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:08.631
THE ELDER WAND --

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.504
THE MOST POWERFUL WAND
EVER MADE.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.169
THE RESURRECTION STONE.

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:39.531
THE CLOAK OF INVISIBILITY.

00:00:41.011 --> 00:00:44.841
TOGETHER, THEY MAKE
THE DEATHLY HALLOWS.

00:00:44.885 --> 00:00:50.717
TOGETHER,
THEY MAKE ONE MASTER OF DEATH.

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:59.900
THAT MARK WAS ON A GRAVE
IN GODRIC'S HOLLOW.

00:00:59.943 --> 00:01:02.424
UH, MR. LOVEGOOD,
DOES THE PEVERELL FAMILY

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:05.035
HAVE ANYTHING TO DO
WITH THE DEATHLY HALLOWS?

00:01:05.079 --> 00:01:08.430
UH, I-I--

00:01:08.473 --> 00:01:10.127
IGNOTUS --
EXCUSE ME --

00:01:10.171 --> 00:01:12.347
AND HIS BROTHERS,
CADMUS AND ANTIOCH,

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:15.306
ARE THOUGHT TO BE THE ORIGINAL
OWNERS OF THE HALLOWS

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.831
AND THEREFORE THE INSPIRATION
FOR THE STORY.

00:01:17.874 --> 00:01:20.311
UH, UH.

00:01:20.355 --> 00:01:22.400
BUT YOUR TEA'S GONE COLD.

00:01:23.619 --> 00:01:26.100
I'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:28.102
HAVE TO GO DOWN HERE.

00:01:28.145 --> 00:01:29.494
SORRY.

00:01:29.538 --> 00:01:31.714
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.499
I'M NOT DRINKING ANY MORE
OF THAT STUFF, HOT OR COLD.

00:01:36.153 --> 00:01:38.678
CUP OF TEA.

00:01:40.244 --> 00:01:43.378
THANK YOU, SIR.

00:01:43.421 --> 00:01:45.554
YOU FORGOT THE WATER.

00:01:45.597 --> 00:01:46.773
WATER?

00:01:46.816 --> 00:01:48.209
FOR THE TEA.

00:01:48.252 --> 00:01:50.298
DID -- DID I?

00:01:50.341 --> 00:01:52.039
[ LAUGHS ]

00:01:52.082 --> 00:01:53.997
H-HOW SILLY OF ME.

00:01:54.041 --> 00:01:55.346
[ LAUGHS ]

00:01:56.478 --> 00:01:57.697
IT'S NO MATTER.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.002
WE REALLY SHOULD BE GOING
ANYWAY.

00:01:59.046 --> 00:02:01.265
NO, YOU CAN'T!

00:02:01.309 --> 00:02:03.441
[ MUTTERING ]

00:02:05.052 --> 00:02:07.402
Harry: SIR?

00:02:14.017 --> 00:02:17.107
YOU'RE MY ONLY HOPE.

00:02:20.894 --> 00:02:25.376
THEY WERE ANGRY, YOU SEE,
ABOUT WHAT I'D BEEN WRITING.

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:30.555
SO THEY TOOK HER.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:35.430
THEY TOOK MY LUNA.

00:02:35.473 --> 00:02:37.867
MY LUNA.

00:02:49.923 --> 00:02:53.535
BUT IT'S REALLY YOU
THEY WANT.

00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:57.757
WHO TOOK HER, SIR?

00:03:01.978 --> 00:03:04.241
VOLDEMORT.

00:03:04.285 --> 00:03:07.810
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:10.682
Hermione: AAH!

00:03:14.774 --> 00:03:16.166
Xenophilius: STOP!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.081
I'VE GOT HIM!

00:03:29.179 --> 00:03:31.225
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:03:34.271 --> 00:03:36.404
THAT TREACHEROUS
LITTLE BLEEDER.

00:03:36.447 --> 00:03:38.188
IS THERE NO ONE WE CAN TRUST?

00:03:38.232 --> 00:03:41.496
THEY KIDNAPPED HER
BECAUSE HE SUPPORTED ME.

00:03:41.539 --> 00:03:43.193
HE WAS JUST DESPERATE.

00:03:43.237 --> 00:03:45.979
I'LL DO THE ENCHANTMENTS.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.992
HELLO, BEAUTIFUL.

00:03:59.035 --> 00:04:01.124
[ GASPS ]

00:04:01.168 --> 00:04:04.301
[ PANTING ][ PANTING ]

00:04:04.345 --> 00:04:05.694
WELL, DON'T HANG ABOUT!

00:04:05.737 --> 00:04:08.044
SNATCH 'EM!

00:04:12.527 --> 00:04:14.311
[ PANTING ]

00:04:20.752 --> 00:04:22.580
AAH!

